orce of 50 N is applied to a small piston of area 20 cm². The large piston has an area of 800 cm². The upward force on the large piston is:",["1.25 N","50 N","40,000 N","2000 N"],"D",5,1,"gen-physics-p5-hydraulic",0],["A wire 5 m long is stretched by 2 mm. The strain in the wire is:",["0.0004","2500","0.004","0.4"],"A",5,0,"gen-physics-p5-strain",0],["A wire 4 m long is stretched by 1 mm. The strain in the wire is:",["0.25","0.0025","0.00025","4000"],"C",5,0,"gen-physics-p5-strain",0],["A wire 4 m long is stretched by 5 mm. The strain in the wire is:",["1.25","800","0.00125","0.0125"],"C",5,0,"gen-physics-p5-strain",0],["A wire 2 m long is stretched by 2 mm. The strain in the wire is:",["0.001","1","1000","0.01"],"A",5,0,"gen-physics-p5-strain",0],["A wire 4 m long is stretched by 2 mm. The strain in the wire is:",["0.005","0.5","2000","0.0005"],"D",5,0,"gen-physics-p5-strain",0],["A wire 1 m long is stretched by 5 mm. The strain in the wire is:",["200","5","0.005","0.05"],"C",5,0,"gen-physics-p5-strain",0]]$j$::jsonb, true);
